      "name": "REQ_004",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Render Card Markdown</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tThe tooling SHALL render per-card Markdown documentation and a mission executive<BR/> summary into a user-specified output directory. Rendered files SHOULD mirror th<BR/>e source card layout (card-type subfolders) and MUST be produced only after the <BR/>model validates without errors.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
