      "_gvid": 3,
      "name": "REQ_002",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Discover and Load Models</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tThe tooling SHALL discover one or more Aurora model homes from an input path (fi<BR/>le, model-home directory, or ancestor directory) and load all card files under e<BR/>ach model home. Discovery is schema-based (presence of Aurora.schema.*), support<BR/>s a direct child &apos;aurora/&apos; folder, and bounds directory walking (max depth) for <BR/>predictable performance.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
